<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Mayne Nickless sees no divestments.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Mayne Nickless sees no divestments.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport and healthcare group Mayne Nickless Ltd said on Tuesday that the company did not expect to divest any of its assets in the year to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't expect to have any further divestments this year,&quot; managing director Bob Dalziel told reporters after the company's annual meeting.</p>
</text>
